Apache License 2.0 — applies to the SOURCE CODE of the AI Model Fusion Lab.

NOTE ON PRODUCED MODELS: any model produced by this lab is a derivative of its
registered source models and inherits their licenses. The licensing engine
(licensing/registry.py) evaluates distributability before any artifact leaves
the lab; configurations containing restricted sources are marked
NOT DISTRIBUTABLE. Closed-weight models (Claude, ChatGPT, etc.) cannot be
sources at all: their weights do not exist publicly and their terms restrict
output distillation — the registry records this explicitly.
